  "prefLabel": "Lot 8109.01 ADW Provider’s Dispute Process",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Lot 8109.01 ADW Provider’s Dispute Process.\n\n(a) Each ADW provider shall publish a dispute process and make such publication generally available to account holders.\n\n(b) The dispute process shall permit account holders to file grievances either orally or in writing.\n\n(c) The ADW provider shall notify the account holder of the disposition of grievances either orally or in writing for grievances within 30 days of the grievance being filed.\n\nSource. #14448, eff 12-3-25, EXPIRES: 12-3-35",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/lot8100.html"
